comments.body:
> @savek-cc do you have some more details on how to connect and run SQL?

@ToreBj Use the import/export in xDrip to export the database. This will result in a zipped database backup on your phone. Copy that zip to your pc and extract it.
Afterwards you can use an SQLite browser to look at the data and run SQL statement on it. I used https://sqlitebrowser.org/ for that purpose.
